invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_product.h
catches: diff_rsa_ifma
reason: normalize_digits hands the register above bit 6 of the generate
  mask in place of bit 7, so the carry the top lane of each register sends
  arrives only when the lane below it sends one. bin/diff_rsa_ifma holds
  normalize_digits, lane for lane, to spec/lean/Spec/RsaIfma.lean's
  normalize, whose register steps the proof of normalize_value covers,
  which is what makes that proof a proof about this file.

--- old
        generate_from_below = generate >> 7;
--- new
        generate_from_below = generate >> 6;
